// TEST: An unannotated lambda passed where the body applies it to an array (rejects)
// ERROR: BL3001 @ 7:12
// ============================================================================
// `f(x)` with `x` an array at this call: the passed lambda's unannotated
// parameter was typed as a single value (its body's arithmetic is), so it is
// not made an array here. Annotate it (`lambda(v: Float64^1) -> ..`).
function ap(f, x) = f(x)
let t = ap(lambda(v) -> v * 2.0, [1.0, 2.0])
